      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAIDA GWAII (5) hasn't trialled since June but did have three trials in readiness for her fresh run. The time between trials and fresh run is a query, but she's won 2/3 first-up and Chris Parnham knows her well. Can sit up front from the outset and give them something to chase. PIN DEEP (6) won well two back before jumping an odds-on favourite last time out, missing by 0.3L. Will need a touch of luck from the draw, but he has good early speed and can put himself in a handy position. Racing in good order and he can put his best foot forward once again. SEPTEMBER BORN (7) boasts a good fresh record and he is a winner when first-up in the past. His recent trial was solid and he is a winner over this track and trip previously. Still has some upside and won't be far away. GINNIVAN (2) caused an upset win last time out and can repeat the dose.",
